ion des omoplates, protraction / rétraction des épaules", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/1IYVBktziso"}, {"code": "A3", "name": "Pull-over haltère avec hanches fléchies", "reps": "12 - 10", "color": "blue", "recup": null, "tempo": "très lent", "charge": "haltère 10kg", "series": "2", "block_type": "standard", "rpe_target": null, "youtube_id": "FYk5MKO-2pg", "coach_notes": "Exercice de coordination, garde buste droit & bras tendus", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/FYk5MKO-2pg"}, {"code": "B", "name": "Tractions pronation en endurance EMOM6''", "reps": "60 en tout", "color": "red", "recup": "1''", "tempo": "2010", "charge": "pdc", "series": "EMOM6''", "block_type": "emom", "rpe_target": null, "youtube_id": "SCVCLChPQFY", "coach_notes": "Place tes yeux sous la barre, trajectoire en biais jusqu''à la ligne des tétons", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SCVCLChPQFY&amp;pp=ygULYmVuY2ggcHJlc3M%3D"}, {"code": "C", "name": "Pompes lestées mains surélevées", "reps": "10 - 8", "color": "green", "recup": "2''", "tempo": "2010", "charge": "leste 10kg", "series": "3", "block_type": "standard", "rpe_target": null, "youtube_id": "4C8sU1Klutw", "coach_notes": "Cherche une amplitude maximale, étirement max avant de charger", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/4C8sU1Klutw"}, {"code": "D1", "name": "Rowing buste penché barre", "reps": "10 - 8", "color": "green", "recup": "2''", "tempo": "2010", "charge": "25 / côté", "series": "3", "block_type": "standard", "rpe_target": null, "youtube_id": "RsPiZION0kE", "coach_notes": "Emmène barre au nombril , relâche complètement épaules en bas", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/RsPiZION0kE"}, {"code": "D2", "name": "Oiseaux assis sur banc", "reps": "12 - 10", "color": "yellow", "recup": null, "tempo": "2010", "charge": "haltères 6kg", "series": "3", "block_type": "standard", "rpe_target": null, "youtube_id": "nlkF7_2O_Lw", "coach_notes": "Monte le petit doigt au niveau de l''épa